msgctxt "Languages::cvc.mode_settings_info"
msgid "<p><b>Virtual mode</b> - products will be displayed on virtual category without directly links to the virtual category. When customer opens virtual category - products will be displayed according virtual category settings in real time.</p>
<p><b>Hard linked mode</b> - products will be attached to virtual category by directly links. Products will be displayed linked at the current mode. Hard linked mode can be used also for automatically fillings products into categories. And if you unmark than category as virtual - products will be stayed on this category.</p>"
msgstr "<p><b>Virtual mode</b> - products will be displayed on virtual category without directly links to the virtual category. When customer opens virtual category - products will be displayed according virtual category settings in real time.</p>
<p><b>Hard linked mode</b> - products will be attached to virtual category by directly links. Products will be displayed linked at the current mode. Hard linked mode can be used also for automatically fillings products into categories. And if you unmark than category as virtual - products will be stayed on this category.</p>"

